  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Allow managed content to be sent to a client-selected store on the backend.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The requirement for this feature would be that the logic can occur \"above\" Fedora.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "So there needs to be a way to signal Fedora on a per-managed-datastream basis, which backend store the content needs to be saved in.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
